1d4ed8\">\n            \u007b\u007bcode\u007d\u007d\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"margin:10px 0 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#64748b;text-align:left\">\n          <span>Valid until: </span><span>\u007b\u007bexpires_at\u007d\u007d</span>\n        </p>\n        <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-top:24px;padding-top:18px\"\n          data-section=\"safety-footer\">\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#92400e;font-weight:650\">If\n            this was not you</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;line-height:1.8\">Please ignore this email.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n",
        "text": "{{ (fromJSON .Computed.brand).title }}\n\nAuthenticator reset code\n\nYou are resetting the authenticator for account \u007b\u007baccount\u007d\u007d.\n\nConfirmation invalidates the previous authenticator, recovery codes and signed-in sessions.\n\n\u007b\u007bcode\u007d\u007d\n\nValid until: \u007b\u007bexpires_at\u007d\u007d\n\nIf this was not you\n\nPlease ignore this email.",
