der-radius:6px;line-height:1.5\">Confirm\n            email unlinking</a>\n          <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#64748b\"><span>Link valid\n              until </span><span>\u007b\u007bexpires_at\u007d\u007d</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:26px;padding-top:8px\">\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 7px;line-height:1.8\">If the button does\n            not work, copy the link into your browser:</p>\n          <p\n            style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#475569;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;margin:0\">\n            \u007b\u007baction_url\u007d\u007d\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-top:24px;padding-top:18px\"\n          data-section=\"safety-footer\">\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#92400e;font-weight:650\">If\n            this was not you</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;line-height:1.8\">Please ignore this email.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n",
        "text": "{{ (fromJSON .Computed.brand).title }}\n\nConfirm email unlinking\n\nYou are unlinking this email address from account \u007b\u007baccount\u007d\u007d.\n\nAfter unlinking, it cannot be used to sign in or verify your identity for this account.\n\nConfirm email unlinking\n\nLink valid until \u007b\u007bexpires_at\u007d\u007d\n\nIf the button does not work, copy the link into your browser:\n\n\u007b\u007baction_url\u007d\u007d\n\nIf this was not you\n\nPlease ignore this email.",
        "subject": "[Security confirmation] Confirm email unlinking",
        "preview_values": {
            "account": "ex***",
            "action_url": "http://127.0.0.1/",
            "expires_at": "2026-11-13 18:10:00"
        }
    },
    "zh-CN": {
        "html": "<div\n  style=\"margin:0;padding:28px 16px;background:#eef2f6;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Arial,sans-serif\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\"\n    style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;margin:auto;border-spacing:0;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #a65312\">\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:30px 32px 32px\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"\n          style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 27px\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"vertical-align:middle;padding:0 10px 0 0\"><img\n                  src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\n                  width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"{{ (fromJSON .Computed.brand).title }}\" style=\"display:block;border:0\"></td>\n              <td\n                style=\"vertical-align:middle;color:#0f172a;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2\">\n                {{ (fromJSON .Computed.brand).title }}</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <h1\n          style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 17px;letter-spacing:-0.4px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700\">\n          确认解绑邮箱</h1>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#475569;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">\n          <span>将解除账号 </span><strong\n            style=\"font-weight:650;color:#0f172a\">\u007b\u007baccount\u007d\u007d</strong><span> 与此邮箱的绑定。</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#475569\">解绑后，此邮箱无法用于登录和身份验证。\n        </p>\n        <div style=\"margin:24px 0 0\">\n          <a href=\"\u007b\u007baction_url\u007d\u007d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n            style=\"display:inline-block;background:#a65312;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;line-height:1.5\">确认解绑邮箱</a>\n          <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#64748b\"><span>链接有效期至\n            </span><span>\u007b\u007bexpires_at\u007d\u007d</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:26px;padding-top:8px\">\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 7px;line-height:1.8\">按钮无法打开时，请复制链接到浏览器：\n          </p>\n          <p\n            style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#475569;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;margin:0\">\n            \u007b\u007baction_url\u007d\u007d\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-top:24px;padding-top:18px\"\n          data-section=\"safety-footer\">\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#92400e;font-weight:650\">\n            如非本人操作</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;line-height:1.8\">请忽略此邮件。</p>\n        </div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n",
        "text": "{{ (fromJSON .Computed.brand).title }}\n\n确认解绑邮箱\n\n将解除账号 \u007b\u007baccount\u007d\u007d 与此邮箱的绑定。\n\n解绑后，此邮箱无法用于登录和身份验证。\n\n确认解绑邮箱\n\n链接有效期至 \u007b\u007bexpires_at\u007d\u007d\n\n按钮无法打开时，请复制链接到浏览器：\n\n\u007b\u007baction_url\u007d\u007d\n\n如非本人操作\n\n请忽略此邮件。",
        "subject": "【安全确认】确认解绑邮箱",
        "preview_values": {
            "account": "ex***",
            "action_url": "http://127.0.0.1/",
            "expires_at": "2026-11-13 18:10:00"
        }
