s:6px;line-height:1.5\">View\n            activity logs</a></p>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:26px;padding-top:8px\">\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 7px;line-height:1.8\">If the button does\n            not work, copy the link into your browser:</p>\n          <p\n            style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#475569;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;margin:0\">\n            \u007b\u007baudit_url\u007d\u007d\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-top:24px;padding-top:18px\"\n          data-section=\"safety-footer\">\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#92400e;font-weight:650\">If\n            this was not you</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;line-height:1.8\">Please review the\n            activity logs or contact your administrator.</p>\n        </div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n",
        "text": "{{ (fromJSON .Computed.brand).title }}\n\n✓Binding successful\n\nAuthenticator linked\n\nAn authenticator has been linked to your account \u007b\u007baccount\u007d\u007d.\n\nView activity logs\n\nIf the button does not work, copy the link into your browser:\n\n\u007b\u007baudit_url\u007d\u007d\n\nIf this was not you\n\nPlease review the activity logs or contact your administrator.",
